  "$schema": "./SCHEMA.md#cross-node-login",
  "description": "Cross-node login grant signing (epic #623/#707, avalon_protocol::cross_node_login::signing_bytes). A CrossNodeLoginGrant is a short, self-signed assertion an already-registered identity mints with its own Ed25519 event-signing key to log into a node it has never registered a passkey on. Each SDK must derive byte-for-byte identical signing bytes and an identical Ed25519 signature from the same inputs and signing key.",
